/*!
\page page_strpstrack StRpsTrack

\brief Reconstructed forward proton track in the Roman Pot System.

\section rpstrack_overview Overview

StRpsTrack is a fully reconstructed forward proton track in the **Roman Pot System (RPS)**.
It is built from one or two StRpsTrackPoint objects (local hit positions, one per station)
and carries the three-momentum vector plus derived physics observables: scattering angles
(θ_x, θ_y, θ), azimuthal angles (φ), Mandelstam *t*, fractional momentum loss ξ, and
time-of-flight.

**Detector**: Roman Pot System (RPS / pp2pp)  
**Stage**: Track finding + momentum reconstruction

\section rpstrack_hierarchy Class Hierarchy

\code
TObject → StObject → StRpsTrack
\endcode

Stored in \c StRpsCollection via \c StSPtrVecRpsTrack; retrieved via
\c StRpsCollection::tracks().

\section rpstrack_branch Branch Numbering

| \c mBranch | Label |
|-----------|-------|
| 0 | EU (East Upper) |
| 1 | ED (East Down) |
| 2 | WU (West Upper) |
| 3 | WD (West Down) |

\section rpstrack_types Track Type Enum

| Enumerator | Meaning |
|------------|---------|
| \c rpsLocal | Single-station track |
| \c rpsGlobal | Two-station track; full momentum reconstruction |
| \c rpsUndefined | Type not assigned |

\section rpstrack_members Data Members

| Type | Member | Description |
|------|--------|-------------|
| \c StPtrVecRpsTrackPoint | \c mTrackPoints | Pointers to the two local track points (one per station) |
| \c StThreeVectorF | \c mP | Reconstructed three-momentum (GeV/c) |
| \c Int_t | \c mBranch | Detector branch index (0–3) |
| \c StRpsTrackType | \c mType | Track type (local / global / undefined) |

\section rpstrack_methods Key Methods

| Method | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| \c trackPoint(station) | Track point for station 0 or 1 |
| \c pVec() | Three-momentum vector (GeV/c) |
| \c branch() | Branch index (0–3) |
| \c type() | Track type |
| \c theta(coord) | Scattering angle θ_x, θ_y, or θ (rad) |
| \c thetaRp(coord) | Geometric scattering angle at the RP (rad) |
| \c phi() | Azimuthal angle φ from momentum (rad) |
| \c phiRp() | Azimuthal angle φ measured at the RP (rad) |
| \c t(beamP) | Mandelstam variable *t* (GeV²) |
| \c xi(beamP) | Fractional momentum loss ξ |
| \c p() | Momentum magnitude (GeV/c) |
| \c pt() | Transverse momentum (GeV/c) |
| \c eta() | Pseudorapidity |
| \c time() | Average PMT TOF signal (ns); −1 if unavailable |

\section rpstrack_example Usage Example

\code{.cpp}
double beamP = 100.0; // GeV/c
for (unsigned int it = 0; it < rpsColl->numberOfTracks(); ++it) {
    const StRpsTrack* trk = rpsColl->track(it);
    if (trk->type() != StRpsTrack::rpsGlobal) continue;
    double xi  = trk->xi(beamP);
    double t   = trk->t(beamP);
    double phi = trk->phi();
}
\endcode

\see StRpsTrackPoint, StRpsCollection
*/
